  <ul class="tags">
    <li>JavaScript</li><li>pdf.js</li><li>Tesseract OCR (WebAssembly)</li><li>ExcelJS</li>
    <li>Content-Security-Policy</li><li>Web Workers</li><li>Layout-aware text extraction</li><li>Windows one-click launcher</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="u-margin-top-16px">It is delivered as a small folder that runs on the user's own machine (or on a private page), with no installation and no accounts.</p>
